### List locations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/locations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get one location
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/locations/{{locationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a location
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/locations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "locationName": "HTTP Test Location",
  "address": "100 HTTP Test Street",
  "locationDescription": "Created from IntelliJ HTTP Client"
}

### Replace a location
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/locations/{{locationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "locationName": "Updated HTTP Location",
  "address": "200 HTTP Test Street",
  "locationDescription": "Replaced from IntelliJ HTTP Client"
}

### Partially update a location
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/locations/{{locationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "locationDescription": "Patched from IntelliJ HTTP Client"
}

### Get a missing location: should return 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/locations/999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
